:''Not to be confused with [[Brainwashed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Lizard Cat]].''
'''Malevolent King Dragon Cat''' is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy that appears in [[Spitting Death (Merciless)|The Malevolent Lizard]]. He was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Malevolent King Dragon Cat
|image = E 667.png
|first appearance = [[Spitting Death (Merciless)|The Malevolent Lizard]]
|money drop = 1,350¢ - 5,332¢
}}

==Enemy==
Effectively a stronger [[Manic King Dragon (Enemy)|Manic King Dragon]], Malevolent King Dragon Cat boasts similar stats, but with 66% more damage, 4 knockbacks instead of 8, the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] trait, [[Surge Attack#Counter-Surge|Counter-Surge]], and a [[Shield]] with 70,000 HP that results in an effective health of 980,000. Fortunately, they don't spawn in groups, but their support in their [[Spitting Death (Merciless)|debut stage]] makes them much deadlier.

